    "只填到域名（和端口），不含 /v1 等路径。OpenAI 兼容端点同理，如 https://api.deepseek.com、http://localhost:11434。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enter only the domain (and port), without paths like /v1. The same goes for OpenAI-compatible endpoints, such as https://api.deepseek.com or http://localhost:11434."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ドメイン（とポート）までを入力し、/v1 などのパスは含めません。OpenAI 互換エンドポイントも同様です（例：https://api.deepseek.com、http://localhost:11434）。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "도메인(과 포트)까지만 입력하고 /v1 같은 경로는 포함하지 않습니다. OpenAI 호환 엔드포인트도 마찬가지입니다(예: https://api.deepseek.com, http://localhost:11434)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只填到網域（和連接埠），不含 /v1 等路徑。OpenAI 相容端點同理，如 https://api.deepseek.com、http://localhost:11434。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只存在这台 Mac 上，留最近 300 条结果。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stored only on this Mac. The latest 300 results are kept."
          }
