    "在本机开一个 SOCKS5 代理，由客户端按需选目标。用于浏览器 / 工具经此主机访问内网。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opens a SOCKS5 proxy on this device; clients pick destinations as needed. Lets browsers and tools reach the internal network through this host."
          }
